OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of music lovers are getting
OL,8,Fready to nab tickets for Glastonbury
OL,9,F2027
OL,11,FThe sale goes live at 09:00 BST and
OL,12,Fbuyers will be able to secure up to six
OL,13,Ftickets - the first batch sold out in
OL,14,Fless than 30 minutes on Thursday
OL,16,FFrom forming syndicates to casting
OL,17,Fspells to win favour with the festival
OL,18,Fgods, we're hearing about your tips and
OL,19,Ftricks to battle the queue
