OL,6,
OL,7,FOrganisers have warned buyers not to
OL,8,Fuse multiple tabs or refresh the page
OL,9,Fwhile they try to get through the queue
OL,11,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,12,Fthis year, which means each registered
OL,13,Fattendee only gets one place in the
OL,14,Fline - one festival veteran says "it's
OL,15,Fliterally a lottery"
OL,17,FTickets to Britain's biggest music
OL,18,Ffestival now cost more than #400
OL,19,F($528). In 1970, the event cost #1 and
